---
export const title = 'Accessibility and events';
export const order = 400;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
import Highlighter from '../../../../components/Highlighter.astro';
---

<p class='text-body-medium'>
  The panel opens in the browser's top layer, so it shows above modals, sheets and menus. It is a
  non-modal dialog: Escape closes it, and so does a press outside the trigger and the panel
  (<code>no-light-dismiss</code> keeps it open on outside presses). Name the dialog with <code>label</code>,
  or put a heading in the content's <code>heading</code> slot. With <code>trigger="click"</code> or
  <code>"hover"</code> the trigger gets <code>aria-haspopup="dialog"</code>, <code>aria-controls</code> and
  <code>aria-expanded</code>; with <code>"manual"</code> the code that opens the popover sets them.
</p>
<p class='text-body-medium'>
  Use a popover, not a tooltip, for rich content with actions.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang='html'>
  <wc-popover trigger='click' arrow>
    <wc-button variant='outlined'>What's new</wc-button>
    <wc-popover-content>
      <h3 slot='heading' class='text-title-small'>Shared drafts</h3>
      <p class='text-body-medium'>Drafts are now visible to everyone on the project.</p>
      <wc-button variant='text' size='sm'>Learn more</wc-button>
    </wc-popover-content>
  </wc-popover>
</DemoComponentCard>

<p class='text-body-medium'>
  <code>open</code> fires when the popover opens and <code>close</code> when it closes, with
  <code>detail.reason</code>: <code>escape</code>, <code>light-dismiss</code> (a press outside, or the
  pointer leaving a hover trigger), <code>action</code> (a second click on the trigger) or <code>api</code>
  (<code>hide()</code> or <code>open = false</code>). Both bubble and cross shadow roots.
</p>

<Highlighter lang={'javascript'} is:raw>const popover = document.querySelector('wc-popover');

popover.addEventListener('close', event => {
  if (event.target !== popover) return;
  console.log('Closed by', event.detail.reason);
});</Highlighter>
